# TPE monitor boot from floppy (task 3 smoke test).
# Assumes a freshly reset board at the OPCOM '#' prompt.
# KNOWN OPEN BUG: CONF/LOAD report "TPE version too old" - this script
# only gates the BOOT and prompt liveness, not the overlays.
LABEL boot TPE from floppy
SEND 1560&
EXPECT 90 TPE Monitor, ND-100 series
EXPECT 30 TPE>
LABEL prompt idle
QUIET 5
LABEL prompt answers (unknown command returns to the prompt)
SEND XYZZY
SENDCR
EXPECT 20 TPE>
